From 2246dcfb08346150922c46c8aaa9e0e5662546a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zee-B33 <202631651+Zee-B33@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:18:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(dsv41): size the structured-output bitmask for copy-draft
 verify rows

Upstream base: local-inference-lab/vllm 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
with candidate-60's series applied through 0816.

Rationale: StructuredOutputManager sizes the grammar bitmask by
num_speculative_tokens (5), but DSpark copy drafts verify up to
num_verification_tokens (16) rows per request. Roughly 6-16 concurrent
response_format requests whose answers copy long prompt spans overrun the
bitmask; xgrammar's bounds check then raises inside grammar_bitmask() and the
engine exits, failing every in-flight request (#1194). Size the bitmask by the
larger of the two. Diagnosis and fix by Zee-B33 in #1194.

Quality implications: None on outputs. The bitmask grows from 96 to 272 rows
at 16 seats (about 1.6 MB to 4.4 MB at the 129,280-token vocabulary); the row
layout and the slice sent to workers are unchanged. backend_outlines.py and
backend_lm_format_enforcer.py also read num_speculative_tokens and are not
changed.

Tests: JSON-burst probe (two waves of 32 concurrent json_object/json_schema
requests whose answers copy 40 records from the prompt): 64/64 HTTP 200,
valid JSON, exact counts, engine alive, on three candidate-60 boots carrying
this change as a file mount (4x GB10, switched, TP4, 32 seats), and 32/32 on
a fourth. The crash itself was not
reproduced here; reproductions are in #1194.

Upstream status: local patch proposal; vllm-project/vllm has no
num_verification_tokens.
---
 vllm/v1/structured_output/__init__.py | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/vllm/v1/structured_output/__init__.py b/vllm/v1/structured_output/__init__.py
index c1ac615..777da2e 100644
--- a/vllm/v1/structured_output/__init__.py
+++ b/vllm/v1/structured_output/__init__.py
@@ -347,6 +347,13 @@ class StructuredOutputManager:
 
         # Covers both speculative decoding and diffusion LLMs (canvas_length).
         max_num_spec_tokens = self.vllm_config.num_speculative_tokens
+        spec_config = self.vllm_config.speculative_config
+        if spec_config is not None and getattr(
+            spec_config, "num_verification_tokens", None
+        ):
+            max_num_spec_tokens = max(
+                max_num_spec_tokens, spec_config.num_verification_tokens
+            )
 
         if self._grammar_bitmask is None:
             assert self.backend is not None
